# Real, DUA-governed corpora (n2c2, MIMIC-IV, etc. -- issue #126, Tier 1). The
# fixed-filename list above only protects TODAY's default output names living directly
# in scripts/; a real corpus saved under any other name, in any format, anywhere else
# in this directory had zero automatic protection before this. Put real data ONLY under
# real_data/ -- everything in it is ignored except its own README, regardless of name.
real_data/*
!real_data/README.md
